 ## Appendix E: Format version changes
 
+### Version 4
+
+Tables using format version 4 write data manifests and delete manifests as Parquet files by default. Format versions 1 through 3 continue to use Avro manifests.
+
+Version 4 manifest readers and writers must support both Avro and Parquet manifests when the format is explicitly selected.
+
+For unpartitioned tables, the `partition` field is omitted from Parquet manifests because Parquet cannot store empty structs. Readers must handle manifests where the `partition` field is absent and treat the partition as unpartitioned.
+
 ### Version 3
 
 Default values are added to struct fields in v3.
